## 3. Data model

Tables are created automatically on first start (`config/database.go`).

### users

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| name | TEXT | Full name |
| email | TEXT | Unique, stored lowercase |
| phone | TEXT | Kenyan mobile number |
| password | TEXT | bcrypt hash (never returned in JSON) |
| meter_account | TEXT | Kenya Power account number (unique) |
| meter_number | TEXT | Physical meter serial (unique) |
| role | TEXT | `tenant` \| `landlord` \| `admin` |
| created_at | DATETIME | |

### meters

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| user_id | TEXT | FK → users.id |
| landlord_id | TEXT | FK → users.id (nullable) |
| meter_number | TEXT | Meter serial |
| units_remaining | REAL | kWh balance |
| daily_avg_units | REAL | Rolling daily average |
| last_reading_at | DATETIME | |
| auto_topup | INTEGER | 0/1 |
| topup_threshold | REAL | Auto top-up trigger |
| topup_amount | INTEGER | Auto top-up amount (KSh) |
| updated_at | DATETIME | |

### usage_history

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| meter_id | TEXT | FK → meters.id |
| units_remaining | REAL | Snapshot reading |
| recorded_at | DATETIME | |

### tokens

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| user_id | TEXT | FK → users.id |
| meter_id | TEXT | FK → meters.id |
| token_number | TEXT | 20-digit KP token |
| units | REAL | kWh credited |
| amount_ksh | INTEGER | Amount paid |
| payment_ref | TEXT | Internal reference |
| pushed_at | DATETIME | Bluetooth push time |
| push_status | TEXT | pending / success / failed / manual |
| purchased_at | DATETIME | |
| deleted | INTEGER | Soft-delete flag |

### transactions

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| user_id | TEXT | FK → users.id |
| token_id | TEXT | FK → tokens.id (nullable) |
| channel | TEXT | mpesa / airtel / bank |
| phone | TEXT | |
| amount_ksh | INTEGER | |
| reference | TEXT | Internal reference |
| provider_ref | TEXT | M-Pesa/Airtel reference |
| status | TEXT | pending / success / failed / cancelled |
| created_at / updated_at | DATETIME | |

### alerts

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | TEXT | UUID (PK) |
| user_id | TEXT | FK → users.id |
| type | TEXT | low_units / days_left |
| threshold | REAL | |
| channel | TEXT | push / sms / email |
| enabled | INTEGER | 0/1 |
| last_fired_at | DATETIME | |
| created_at | DATETIME | |

