| `ADMIN_EMAIL` | empty | Seeded admin email (required to seed) |
| `ADMIN_PASSWORD` | empty | Seeded admin password (required to seed) |
| `MPESA_CONSUMER_KEY` | empty | Daraja consumer key |
| `MPESA_CONSUMER_SECRET` | empty | Daraja consumer secret |
