| `MPESA_CALLBACK_SECRET` | empty | Shared secret expected in `X-Webhook-Secret` header |
| `AIRTEL_API_KEY` | empty | Airtel Money API key |
| `AIRTEL_CALLBACK_URL` | empty | Airtel callback URL |
| `AIRTEL_CALLBACK_SECRET` | empty | Shared secret for Airtel callbacks |
| `BANK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER` | empty | Virtual account number |
| `BANK_NAME` | empty | Bank name |

