## 8. First-run walkthrough

### Register a tenant

1. Open `http://localhost:8080/`.
2. Click **Create account**.
3. Choose **Tenant / Consumer**, fill in your name, email, phone, an 8–12 digit meter account
   number and a strong password.
4. Submit — you are signed in automatically and land on **Tenant Dashboard**.

### Buy a token

1. On the tenant dashboard open the **Top-up** tab.
2. Enter a phone number, pick an amount (100 / 200 / 500 / 1000) and a channel.
3. Click **Buy token** — the token is generated, recorded to history and shown on screen.

> With no live payment credentials configured, tokens are still generated instantly using the
> built-in development token provider, so the full flow works out of the box.

### Sign in as a landlord

1. On the portal choose **Create account** → **Landlord**.
2. After registration you land on the **Landlord Dashboard** (fleet token workflow + audit ledger).

### Sign in as an administrator

1. Make sure `ADMIN_EMAIL` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD` are set in `.env` **before** the server first
   starts (the account is seeded at startup).
2. Open `http://localhost:8080/admin-login.html`.
3. Sign in — you are redirected to the **Admin Console** showing global stats, users, meters,
   tokens and transactions.

