### 9.8 Admin (role `admin` only)

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/admin/stats` | Global counts |
| GET | `/admin/users` | All accounts |
| GET | `/admin/meters` | All meters + owners |
| GET | `/admin/tokens` | Recent 50 tokens |
| GET | `/admin/transactions` | Recent 50 payments |

Calling any admin endpoint with a tenant/landlord token returns `403 Forbidden`.

